Serves MCP over HTTP POST on loopback, for direct JSON calls

Usage: leptoskit mcp http [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --address <ADDRESS>  The address to bind; loopback only by default [default: 127.0.0.1]
      --port <PORT>        The port to listen on [default: 7331]
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
